{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-04-06 16:44:00', 'title': "EDUARDO CONRADO AND ELAINE MENDOZA NOMINATED TO JOIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES' BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS NAMED EDUARDO CONRADO AND ELAINE MENDOZA AS CANDIDATES TO JOIN THE BOARD. BOTH CONRADO AND MENDOZA, ALONG WITH THE OTHER BOARD NOMINEES, WILL BE ON THE BALLOT AT THE 2023 ANNUAL SHAREHOLDERS MEETING. CONRADO AND MENDOZA ARE BEING CONSIDERED TO SUCCEED CURRENT BOARD MEMBERS JOHN DENISON AND NANCY LOEFFLER WHO HAVE ANNOUNCED THEY WILL NOT STAND FOR RE-ELECTION TO THE BOARD.'}